# refactor/checkout-on-pay (greenfield flag day): the inline checkout creates
# the Stripe subscription when the buyer presses Pay, so the request now names
# the Price the buyer saw. App and API ship together; no released client calls
# the old shape. Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new
# contract.
POST /organizations/{organizationId}/billing/stripe/checkout added required request body

# refactor/checkout-on-pay: see above. A Pay naming a Price the roster no
# longer maps to gets a 409 the client answers by reloading the options.
# Remove this exact diagnostic as soon as main contains the new contract.
POST /organizations/{organizationId}/billing/stripe/checkout added the new `billing_checkout_price_changed` enum value to the `code` response property for the response status `409`
